{"id":"h5b515qy99ppc7odyfj59iry9","title":"黄葛与紫葛的古文献记载","originalTitle":"山耕谭葛 葛的词语典故·黄葛花与紫葛花 紫葛蔓黄花 娟娟寒露中","summary":"《四川中药志》称葛别名“黄葛根”、“黄葛藤”，古代文献中常见“黄葛”、“黄葛花”等名称。唐代李白《黄葛篇》描述黄葛布的制作过程，清代王琦注释称黄葛布因色泽得名。明代《救荒本草》记载紫葛花为粉红、紫色或紫红色，清代胡浚诗中提及“紫葛花”。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=3638195&do=blog&id=1561869"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-19T03:58:20.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-19T09:37:43.719Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-19T09:37:43.719Z","category":null,"tags":["研究成果"],"score":14,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}